<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Sept 20.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Sept 20.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Friday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day upto 0630 GMT and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at (0630 GMT) was 3351.20, 1.43 points or 0.04 percent higher than Thursday's close.</p>
